  "details": "There should be a way to toggle of the controller model showing up in tool tips etc, I only want it for FBT setup. But if we can't have that then at least remove them when opening the main menu. I think they suddenly apparead and I can't tell if it's a bug or not and I haven't seen a word about it. I have tool tips off because I value immersion and a clean look over info on buttons etc. And while that isn't ideal like I mentioned it was ok to have them only show up during FBT setup, but now they also show up in the main menu even with tool tips off.",
